OL,3,AMan who died near Notting Hill Carnival
OL,4,Ais named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died after jumping into a
OL,7,Fcanal while fleeing from police near
OL,8,FNotting Hill Carnival has been named.
OL,10,FKarnell Kelly, 25, died in hospital
OL,11,Fafter entering the Grand Union Canal
OL,12,Foff Kensal Road, west London, while
OL,13,Fbeing pursued by police officers.
OL,15,FHe had fled on foot after the officers
OL,16,Fattempted to stop him near Harrow Road
OL,17,Fas he approached the carnival wearing a
OL,18,Fface covering at about 15:20 BST on
OL,19,FMonday, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
